# Image preview sizing — protected (do not regress)

**User-confirmed (2026-06-30).** Read `memory-bank/image-preview-sizing-protected-state.md` before editing preview/modal CSS.

## Preview vs Expand (never merge)

| | Preview (in-panel) | Expand (click modal) |
|--|------------------|----------------------|
| Size | **250px** (`--panel-image-preview-height`) | **min(80vh, 512px)** (`--expand-modal-image-preview-max-height`) |
| Krea | Task row thumb | Click overlay |
| Texture Extractor | Grid `.texture-preview` | Detail `.texture-details-preview img` |

## Rules

- Do **not** change expand modal to 250px or panel preview to 512px without explicit user request.
- Do **not** use one CSS variable for both contexts.
- Panel preview: no hover grow; expand on click only.
- Tokens live in `expandedImagePreview.css` only.

## Protected

`expandedImagePreview.css`, `ImagePanelPreview.css`, `ImagePanelPreview.jsx`, `TextureExtractor.css` (preview/modal sizing sections)
